# InterAct runs llama3.1:8b with an 8K context. Without this, Ollama uses the
# model's 128K maximum, which needs over 20 GB of memory and makes replies
# very slow on a 16 GB Mac. Our prompts are under 2K tokens.
# Create it with: ollama create interact-llama3.1:8b -f ollama/Modelfile.llama3.1-8b
FROM llama3.1:8b
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
